="center">55.4 &#x000b1; 3.76*</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">14&#x000b0;</td><td align="center">50.5 &#x000b1; 6.48</td><td align="center">53.0 &#x000b1; 6.05</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="center">21&#x000b0;</td><td align="center">7.18 &#x000b1; 1.81&#x02021;</td><td align="center">59.7 &#x000b1; 2.73&#x02021;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>&#x02020; Significant difference between monoaxial screws group and polyaxial screws group (p &#x0003c; 0.05).</p><p>* Significant difference between monoaxial screws group and polyaxial screws group (p &#x0003c; 0.05).</p><p># Significant difference between monoaxial screws group and polyaxial screws group (p &#x0003c; 0.05).</p><p>&#x02021; Significant difference between monoaxial screws group and polyaxial screws group (p &#x0003c; 0.05).</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>